# Mind the Spikes. Hitbox right edge = 47 + 2*tick while holding RIGHT; full jump = 20 ticks of JUMP.
80 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spike pit at columns 13-15
36 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spike at column 21
28 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # void pit at columns 26-28
100 RIGHT          # checkpoint at column 31
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spike pit at columns 41-43
42 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spikes at columns 49-50
24 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # step up 2 at column 56
58 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # void pit at columns 64-66
124 RIGHT          # step down, checkpoint at column 78
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spike at column 83
28 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # spike pit at columns 88-90
300 RIGHT          # run to the exit at column 104
